ety Research and Clinical Support Research and Grants Administration Social Work Speech Therapy Student Support Services Support Services Technician Therapy and Rehabilitation USC Job Families School/Division Select One Keck Medicine of USC Keck School of Medicine Auxiliary Services Herman Ostrow School of Dentistry of USC Dornsife College of Letters, Arts and Sciences Herman Ostrow School of Dentistry Enrollment Services Marshall School of Business Sol Price School of Public Policy Keck School of Medicine of USC Viterbi School of Engineering Alfred E. Mann School of Pharmacy and Pharmaceutical Sciences USC Credit Union Facilities Management Services Gould School of Law University Relations Athletics Communications Human Resources, Ethics, and Compliance Information Technology Services Office of the Provost School of Architecture Administrative Operations SOWK School of Cinematic Arts USC Keck School of Medicine Annenberg School for Communication and Journalism Office of Research Bovard College Capital Construction Dworak-Peck School of Social Work Financial and Business Services Kaufman School of Dance Leonard Davis School of Gerontology Office of the General Counsel Rossier School of Education Global and Online Initiatives Keck School Of Medicine Libraries Office of the Comptroller President Roski School of Art and Design Thornton School of Music USC Dornsife College of Letters, Arts and Sciences University Advancement Add Administrative Support, Los Angeles, California, United States Remove Remove Confirm Email By signing up, I acknowledge I have read the USC privacy policy , and I wish to receive email and SMS communications. I understand I can opt-out from receiving email and SMS communications at any time. sign up Helpful information for applicants External applicants Internal applicants (current USC employees) Employment Equity Read USC's Clery Act Annual Security Report Recruitment Fraud Alert Labor Condition Applications Sitemap Equal Opportunity Statement 