      "title": "Join Our Trojan Community",
      "description": "Rewarding Careers in a Job at University of Southern California USC Skip to main content Life at USC Career Areas Faculty Keck Medicine of USC Auxiliary Services Information Technology Services Human Resources, Ethics, and Compliance USC Advancement Current Employees Returning Applicants Saved Jobs 0 Job Alerts Join Our Trojan Community At USC, we are united by shared values and a bold vision for the future. Join a workplace where your role has meaning, your growth is supported, and your impact is felt across campus, Los Angeles, and the world. Search by Keyword Search Jobs Mission, Culture, Values Guided by Our Mission and Unifying Values Our unifying values provide a strong foundation, not only for what we do but how we do things. As a member of the Trojan Family, you’ll be part of a dynamic culture that celebrates purpose, community, and the pursuit of excellence. Learn more about USC's Unifying Values Featured Areas of Work Faculty Keck Medicine of USC Auxiliary Services Information Technology Services Human Resources, Ethics, and Compliance USC Advancement Faculty USC’s world-class faculty inspire, guide, and drive the engines that move the university forward in knowledge and research. View Faculty Jobs Keck Medicine of USC Keck Medicine of USC is one of Southern California’s premier academic medical centers, where science, compassion, and innovation come together to deliver world-class patient care. View Keck Medicine of USC Jobs Auxiliary Services Auxiliary Services enriches the Trojan experience through USC Bookstores, USC Hospitality, USC Hotel, USC Housing, USC Transportation, and the Los Angeles Memorial Coliseum. View Auxiliary Services Jobs Information Technology Services Information Technology Services (ITS) delivers innovative, sustainable, and people-centric technology solutions, that help to power how the university teaches, learns, and operates. View Information Technology Services jobs Human Resources, Ethics, and Compliance Human Resources, Ethics, and Compliance upholds the university’s culture, equal opportunity, ethics, professionalism, and compliance functions, as well as the traditional areas of HR, to provide the Trojan community with the necessary support to learn, live, and work in a welcoming and safe environment. View HREC Jobs University Advancement University Advancement drives philanthropic support and meaningful engagement across the Trojan Family, advancing USC’s mission through fundraising, alumni relations, and strategic partnerships that create lasting impact for the university and the communities it serves.\r\nView University Advancement Jobs View University Advancement Jobs Benefits and Perks Benefits That Support You in Every Stage of Life We care about your whole self, today and in the future. Our comprehensive benefits support your physical, emotional, and financial well-being, empowering you and your loved ones to thrive. Learn more about USC Benefits Related Content Learn More August 04, 2025 USC News Explore the latest stories of impact, innovation, and Trojan spirit shaping USC and the world beyond. Learn More July 28, 2025 USC News Blog - Hub Page Related Content USC and SoCal Rooted in LA, USC partners with local communities to uplift education, well-being, and opportunity across Southern California. Learn More July 28, 2025 Culture & Community Blog - Hub Page Related Content Our Mission USC’s central mission is the development of human beings and society as a whole through the cultivation and enrichment of the human mind and spirit. Learn More July 28, 2025 Mission & Values Blog - Hub Page Related Content Alumni USC Today’s Alumni page highlights news, achievements, research and stories from USC alumni and the Trojan Family. Learn More August 03, 2026 Culture & Community Article Blog - Hub Page Related Content AI at USC At USC, artificial intelligence is more than just code. It is a catalyst for discovery, creativity and social good. Learn More February 24